                <p n="1">In this village ...</p>
                <p rend="stanza" n="1">In this village the <foreign>brāhmaṇa</foreign> of the Kauśika-gōtra gave, among the shares distributed, for the sake of one share<note><hi rend="italic">Pace</hi> <bibl><ptr target="bib:Kuppusamy+al2010_01"/></bibl>: <q>half of the friend’s share of
this village</q>.</note> to Sōmanātha for the worship during the twilight <supplied reason="explanation"><foreign>pradoṣa</foreign></supplied>.</p>
                <p n="4">These four lands were gifted in Kuḻikkarai.</p>
